---One ranked candidate in a discover response, with everything an agent needs to act.
---@class posthog.mcp_registry.MCPDiscoverCandidate
---@field rank number 1-based position under the ranking version used.
---@field id string Registry server id, for the detail endpoint.
---@field registry_name string Official registry name, empty for measured-only servers.
---@field title string Human-readable server name.
---@field description string What the server does.
---@field score number The server's own standing in [0, 1] under the ranking version used: liveness x trust, independent of the query.
---@field relevance number|distilled.Null How well the server's own text answered `intent`, in [0, 1]. Null when the intent held no words worth matching on.
---@field combined_score number|distilled.Null The value candidates are ordered by: relevance and score combined, weighted toward relevance. Null in two cases. When the intent held no words worth matching on, ordering falls back to `score`. When the ranking version has no completed run, `score` is 0 for every candidate and ordering falls back to `relevance`.
---@field why posthog.mcp_registry.MCPDiscoverCandidateWhyMap Score breakdown so an agent can explain its choice: fit, liveness, trust, and whether real usage signal contributed.
---@field liveness string Probed liveness state (alive_open, alive_auth, dead, ...).
---@field auth_method string Detected auth method (none, oauth, api_key, unknown).
---@field measured posthog.mcp_registry.MCPDiscoverCandidateMeasuredMap|distilled.Null Real MCP Analytics aggregates when the server is measured, otherwise null: calls, sessions, error_rate_pct, intent_coverage_pct, harness_count.
---@field matched_tools posthog.mcp_registry.MCPDiscoverCandidateMatchedToolsList Tools that matched the intent: [{name, description, source}]. Empty when only the server description matched.
---@field connect posthog.mcp_registry.MCPDiscoverCandidateConnectMap Connection instructions, most-automated method first, steps typed by actor so the agent runs its own steps and narrates the human ones.

